        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Osinkolio le nkurma oo Sabibu",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 5:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.5.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.5.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 5:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ore naa, intae iloomanya Yerusalem o ltung'ana le Yuda, atoomono intae, enguanareki nanu o ina kurma ai oo sabibu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.5.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.5.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 5:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kainyoo nanu aitong'oro eitu aas te nkurma ai oo sabibu? Ore pee aanyu nanu metoiu ilng'anayio, kaainyo pee aa isabibu le ntim etoiuo?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.5.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.5.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 5:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.5.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.5.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 5:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ore naa taata kaaliki nanu enalo aitaas enkurma ai oo sabibu Kaiwuang'ie nanu enkikarrata enye, pee eidaikieki; naa kagil nanu isunta enyena pee eitunyori. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.5.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.5.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 5:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kaitaa nanu ninye mijooni; meisampuni ae kata te ninye nemeturi naa kebulunye endiati o lkiku; naa kaitanap sii nkatampo pee meshaiki enchan ninye.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.5.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.5.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Entorroni naas iltung'ana",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 5:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.5.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.5.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 5:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wooi ninche lelo ooruk nkajijik, lelo ooponiki ate ilchampai, o metaba anaa neishunye pooki wueji, nikintaae iyie oloton openy te mpolos e nkop. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.5.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.5.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 5:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Einosa Olaitoriani loo lororani olmumai aning'ito too nkiyiaa aainei: “Esipa kemijoonu nkajijik kumok, nena ajijik sidain sapuki nememanya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.5.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.5.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 5:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Amu ore iyekai tomon oo lng'anayio naa iltuleta isiet ake eitayu le naisho oo sabibu ore enkikapu nabo oo lanterera naa emborei nabo empirbil ake entapa.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.5.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.5.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 5:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Woi ninche lelo ooinyototo aayooki tadekenya, pee etum aakuet aatusujai inaishi naapi, lelo ootoni oleng o metaa kewarie o metaba anaa neidimu ninche enaisho! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.5.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.5.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 5:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Neeta ninche nkinantani o nkai oo sinkolioitin, o ndulen, o naishi too siruai lenye; kake meshilaa ninche nkiaasin o Laitoriani, anaa edol ina siaai oo nkaik enyena. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.5.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.5.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 5:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ore enkaraki ina kepuo iltung'ana laainei eyararoto te nkaraki emodai enye; kemut olameyu ilkituaak lenye, nemuta olorere lenye pooki te nkure. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.5.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.5.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 5:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Neaku eibung'a enemeneng'a esumash, netang'a enkutuk enye aitulus, ore enkitoo e Yerusalem o ilo orora lenye, naa kepuo aadoyio, olorora lenye, o ilo ong'idare. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.5.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.5.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 5:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Eirrugoki tung'ani aaing'orie enkop, neitadowuoki iltung'ana aayau kop, ore nkonyek e ilo oitokoos neitoborraki.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.5.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.5.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 5:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.5.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.5.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 5:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kake ore Olaitoriani loo lororani, neitaaki kitok te sipata, ore Enkai Sinyati neitodolu kewan te sinyatisho te sipata. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.5.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.5.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 5:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ore ilkuoo le kerra, nedaa anaa ilootii endaata enye, ore ilkuoo le kineji nedaa to lmuaate. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.5.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.5.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 5:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Woi ninche lelo ooyietu enkarruoisho too nkeenta e lejare, lelo ooyietu ng'ok anaa too nkeenta e ngarri, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.5.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.5.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 5:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "lelo oojo: “Nchoo ninche eisarrisar, nchoo ninche eitasiooyo esiaai enye pee kitum iyiook aatodol; nchoo eyiolounoto e ilo Sinyati le Israel etaanu, naa nchoo ninye elotu, pee kitum iyiook aatayiolo!” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.5.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.5.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 5:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Woi ninche lelo oojo entorroni eisidai nejo esidano entorroni, nepik enaimin erishata e wang'an, nepik ewang'an erishata e naimin, lelo oopik enduaran erishata e meloni nepik emeloni erishata e nduaran! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.5.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.5.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 5:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Woi ninche lelo ooiteng'enuo too nkonyek enye maate, lelo ooitaa ate kalamasi! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.5.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.5.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 5:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Woi ninche lelo oorup ate te neokieki enaisho, lelo arriyiak te nkitushulata oo naishi naapi, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.5.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.5.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 5:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "lelo oo laaya olarruoni te nkaraki eropata, neoru ilo asipani esipata enye! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.5.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.5.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 5:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Neaku, ore anaa enamut olng'ejep le nkima isuut, o anaa enaibung nkujit naatoito o lng'ejep le nkima, neijia etiu ntona enye, ketiu anaa entoki natong'ua apurda, ore te rishata naitapuku, netiu anaa enterit; enkaraki natanyaita ninche enkitanapata Olaitoriani loo lororani, netemenaitie ninche ororei le Ilo Sinyati le Israel. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.5.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.5.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 5:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ore enkaraki ina eyupuyupo engoro o Laitoriani ti alo iltung'ana lenyena, neitorioyie ninye enkaina enye, aarare ninche neosh ninche, neikirikira oldoinyo; netiu mpopoki enye anaa suut too nkoitoi naalala e nkanasa. Amu ore te kuna pooki meibooroyu engoro enye, neton ake eitoriori enkaina enye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.5.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.5.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 5:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Neyuku ninye olosho olakua, neisulu ninye aipotu meetu aaing'uaa ineeiting'ie enkop; naa ng'ura, nekuetu te ngolon oleng! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.5.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.5.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 5:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Meetae obo lenye onauru, meetae obo lenye orrorro, meetae oloimug neirura, meetae olololong'u enkimeita, nemedung'o enkeene e namuke enye; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.5.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.5.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 5:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "naa kepi mbaa enye, neteyietuoki nkai enye, negol iloisotok loo mbartan enye anaa soito, ore nkejek oo ng'arrin enye epuo anaa osiwuo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.5.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.5.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 5:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Neikununo enkikurrukur enye anaa eno lng'atuny, neikurrukur ninche anaa ilkuoo loo lng'atunyo; keikurrukur ninche neibung'isho, neripaa ninche ina ng'ues naaibung'a, nemeetae ololo arrinyu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.5.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.5.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 5:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ore kenya te ina olong naa keikurrukurroki ninche nena naaibung'a, te nkikurrukur naaijo ene naiposha. Naa te neingor oltung'ani enkop, ng'ura, enaimin ake o osina; ore ewang'an neitomisimis nkatampo enyena.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.5.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.5.30"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
